            "notes": "## POWER\n- [Glass Extra Full](item_659ff350-8602-42cd-b5f9-f4da7e5e912b): This power makes your pocket way more resistant.\n- [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb): This power works very well with [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) and [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca) \n\nNote: [Glass Extra Full](item_659ff350-8602-42cd-b5f9-f4da7e5e912b) is in synergy with [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) because the damage reduction of [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) is also applied to overhealth.\n\n## CORE\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b)\n- [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb): One of the most important item of the build that allows us to do better a flash heal*\n\n## RECOMMENDED\n- Some [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) items\nChoose between:\n- [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca)\n- [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5)",
